<hr />
<h2>4.4 Green Edge Computing Benchmark on ESP32-S3</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Architecture</strong>: Squeeze-and-Excitation Depthwise-Separable 2D CNN (SE-DS-CNN)</li>
<li><strong>Model Format</strong>: INT8 Quantized C++ Array (<code>model_data.h</code>)</li>
<li><strong>Flash Footprint</strong>: <strong>27.4 KB</strong> (28,096 bytes)</li>
<li><strong>SRAM Arena</strong>: <strong>40.0 KB</strong></li>
<li><strong>Inference Time</strong>: <strong>9.5 ms</strong> @ 240 MHz ESP32-S3 clock</li>
<li><strong>Active Current Draw</strong>: <strong>18.5 mA</strong></li>
<li><strong>Sleep Current Draw</strong>: <strong>15 µA</strong></li>
</ul></body></html>